==Latin==

===Alternative spellings===
*[[dies Iouis]]
*[[dies Jovis]] (Mediaeval spelling)

===Etymology===
From [[dies]] + the genitive of [[Iuppiter]].

===Noun===
'''[[dies Iovis]]''' (or [[dies Jovis]])
# [[Thursday]]

